  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support measure in favour of the Syria crisis response for 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Multi-annual work programme in favour of the Syria crisis response for 2022-2023 is a support measure giving the European Commission the possibility to finance measures and activities that are needed for the achievement of the Union&#xBF;s political and financial commitment to support the Syrian people and countries in Syria&#xBF;s neighbourhood affected by the crisis. The support measure will finance administrative, technical and logistical support associated with the preparation, consultation, coordination, follow-up, communication and other activities necessary for the successful organisation of the Brussels conferences and related processes.&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
